  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7506.08 Review Hearing Decision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7506.08 Review Hearing Decision. As a result of the review hearing, the director shall take one of the following actions:\n\n(a) Leave the existing order in place;\n\n(b) Amend the existing order by changing the payment amount, duration, or frequency; or\n\n(c) Rescind the order.\n\nSource. #13938, eff 4-24-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
